[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 421.99, "timestamp": "00:07:01", "text": "しばらく配信してなかったので、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 424.71, "timestamp": "00:07:04", "text": "やり方を忘れてしまいました。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 428.067, "timestamp": "00:07:08", "author": "@kurunekodream", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/RLzqgZjl8ILhIIU27ghgxtcyxaMDaQ4nJQ8GzPmDKVVI7HHPJUZsDQV_Itc49vlXGx8THQhiP90=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hoiiii"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 430.15, "timestamp": "00:07:10", "text": "うーん、それもまた変な感じがする。 ええ、そうですね。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 431.67, "timestamp": "00:07:11", "text": "えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 435.67, "timestamp": "00:07:15", "text": "こんにちは。 ええと、いろいろなことがありました。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 440.23, "timestamp": "00:07:20", "text": "今日は私の復帰配信です。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 442.23, "timestamp": "00:07:22", "text": "だから、えっと、えっと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 450.309, "timestamp": "00:07:30", "text": "どう話せばいいのかわからないんだ、兄弟。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 450.555, "timestamp": "00:07:30", "author": "@ObnoxiousAgnostic", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_kVrH3KET_eX7LDEi_ka-c3eoI3J-Vcy4GX19VQNPnWwZQ=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Suzuki Zuriko sounds a lot like my mom’s yoga teacher Dahli."}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 458.39, "timestamp": "00:07:38", "text": "最近、一連の動画をアップロードしました。 それで、アップロードしたので、えーと、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 464.95, "timestamp": "00:07:44", "text": "みんなが見ることができるようにアップロードしました。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 471.39, "timestamp": "00:07:51", "author": "@Tannu-4xb", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/_JP-8D8zBTzbhDsee74cjCLrBQ_ChSgQg1feSYJ0H0ndg2P0pEtpMtfWfHgIGcMKStiEGX_RNg=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "hiiiiiiiiii"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 471.43, "timestamp": "00:07:51", "text": "質問や何かあれば、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 474.07, "timestamp": "00:07:54", "text": "そのビデオで質問に答えてもらえます。"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 476.459, "timestamp": "00:07:56", "author": "@Tannu-4xb", "avatar": "https:/